  "dek": "The leader cleared the organizer’s stated 85% bonus threshold, while Jack Cole and Jan Disselhoff posted visible gains further down the board.",
  "discord": "ARC-AGI-2 evening: Tufa Labs led the public board at 88.06%, up from a visible 83.61% score event. ARC Prize announced a $150,000 bonus threshold above 85%, but no final award or private result is established. rabbithole and Yi-Chia Chen followed; Jack Cole and Jan Disselhoff posted visible gains. Full sourced report: https://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-09-evening-arc-2",
